		{"id":"context","type":"text","text":"## Context assembly\n\nCurrent chat, personality and eligible memory.\nPass 4 adds scoped retrieval, summaries and model-aware compaction.\n\n[[Memory & Context Policy]]","x":-400,"y":-320,"width":320,"height":230,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"storage","type":"text","text":"## Saved state\n\nVisible conversation and provider state are separate.\n\nPreserve completed activity; do not replay unfinished tool calls.","x":420,"y":-315,"width":340,"height":220}
